        "imageCheck": "No image claimed. Because no dynasty/rebbe was identified, the research correctly provided no portrait. There is no fabricated, gravestone, or dead-link image URL to flag — this is correct, honest handling.",
        "sourceQuality": "Mixed but mostly verifiable. The three rabanut.co.il (Tel Aviv Religious Council) sources resolve and accurately support the secondary claims: בית שלמה = Yona HaNavi 27, Karem HaTeimanim, Edot HaMizrach (NOT on Shlomo HaMelech, not Hasidic); מדרש שלמה = HaMaon 27, Florentine, Nusach Ashkenaz (NOT Hasidic, NOT on Shlomo HaMelech). The Project TLV source resolves and lists buildings 1-109 with NO religious institution at #16. The Glatter PDF (in.bgu.ac.il) returns ECONNREFUSED — genuinely unreachable exactly as the research stated; its content could not be re-verified live, but the abstract (kotar.cet.ac.il) and the provided authoritative index corroborate that שלמה המלך is not among Glatter's streets. No images claimed, so no portrait/gravestone fabrication risk.",
