        "foundingYearCheck": "\"unknown\" for Florentin 44 is correct. For the real Stratyn-Ashlag shtibel, Glatter gives 1944, which is defensible and falls within Brandwein's Tel Aviv/Histadrut period and Glatter's 1940-1965 scope. No anachronism in the corrected record. (The 1885-1954 and 1903-1969 life dates in the background are accurate.)",
