          "BIRTHPLACE ERROR: dynastyBackground says born in Warsaw; he was born in Łuków (Lukow), Congress Poland.",
          "UNVERIFIED HASIDIC TIE: 'Gur' connection is not supported by the cited Wikipedia (only Porisov and Belz are corroborated).",
