        "sourceQuality": "Good and honestly cited. Hebrew Wikipedia and Hamichlol both verified and corroborate the biography word-for-word (they share text, so they are not fully independent). Wikimedia Commons file verified. project-tlv.info verified for the Beit Ziger building. The Glatter source (Michal Glatter, \"אדמו\\\"רים ברחובות תל אביב 1965-1940,\" Iyunim 36, BGU) is real and was surfaced in search (https://in.bgu.ac.il/bgi/iyunim/36/36-Michal-Glatter.pdf), though the PDF body repeatedly returned ECONNREFUSED so I relied on the provided Glatter index plus search snippets. No fabricated URLs detected; all five cited sources resolve.",
