        "foundingYearCheck": "WEAK / MISLEADING as stated. The \"1936\" in foundingYear comes only from Glatter's summary index table (the dynasty's arrival year in Tel Aviv), NOT from the building. Glatter's own detailed text dates the Beit Modzhitz AMUTA registration to ש' תשט\"ז = 2 Feb 1956, and yeshiva.org.il dates the Dizengoff 36 beit midrash to 1957. So the physical Dizengoff 36 institution is a mid-1950s creation, ~20 years after 1936. The claim half-acknowledges this in its gaps. Recommend foundingYear be presented as \"Modzhitz arrived in TA 1936 (Lilienblum); the Dizengoff 36 beit midrash itself dates to ~1956–1957.\"",
