          "BNEI BRAK MOVE ATTRIBUTION: dynastyBackground implies the Bnei Brak/Habakkuk center came 'in the leadership of Rabbi Israel Dan Taub' — correct — but the timeline glosses that this happened in 1995 under the 4th rebbe, not as a direct continuation of Shmuel Eliyahu. Habakkuk house number is 20 (per Waze/sources), which the claim omits.",
