        "addressCheck": "YES — Glatter and open web both support the corrected address. The Glatter index entry lists street \"דיזנגוף\", number \"36\", for Modzhitz under R' Shmuel Eliyahu Taub, archivalRef תיק 1870360. The Tel Aviv Religious Council page (rabanut.co.il) independently confirms \"תפארת שאול - חסידי מודזיץ, דיזנגוף 36\", and Hebrew Wikipedia confirms the Lilienblum→Dizengoff move. The map's \"בוגרשוב 50\" is supported by NO source; the wrong-number flag and corrected address Dizengoff 36 are justified. House number 36 is solid; the archival file numbers themselves could not be independently verified because the BGU PDF server refused all fetch/download attempts during this check.",
