        "corrections": "1) REMOVE the photographer credit '(צילום: רומן וישניאק)' from the image caption — Wikimedia Commons lists the author as Unknown; there is no evidence Roman Vishniac took it. Keep the rest of the caption and the (valid, free) image. 2) Add an explicit caveat that the house number 15 and the archival file (210150 / 6688054) rest solely on Glatter and were not independently corroborated on the open web. 3) Note the birthplace discrepancy: Wikipedia=Parczew, Yad Vashem=Shedlitz/Siedlce. 4) Optionally complete the rebbe's timeline: arrived Eretz Israel 1945, rabbi of São Paulo from 1947, then Holon from 1963 — to avoid implying a direct Budapest->Holon path. 5) Normalize the Yad Vashem URL host to www.yadvashem.org. 6) Where Glatter and open-web reasoning could diverge on house number, GLATTER WINS per instructions (academic source citing the TA municipal archive); the research correctly defers to it and sets mapErrorFlag 'none'. Net: the core claim (a Munkacs shtibel at HaAvoda 15, Tel Aviv, ~1944, dynasty of R. Rabinowicz who lived elsewhere) is sound; the only outright fabrication is the Vishniac photo credit."
