          "GLATTER-vs-WEB DISCREPANCY: Glatter places the 'moved to Pinkas in the 1960s' note under the MAIN Sadigura entry (R. Avraham Yaakov Friedman), but the web (Hebrew Wikipedia, tog.org) shows it was R. Mordechai Shalom Yosef (Przemysl branch) who reopened the Pinkas synagogue. WEB is correct. The research follows the web but slightly overstates harmony with Glatter — it should say Glatter is imprecise here, not merely that Glatter 'puts Pinkas under the main court'.",
