        ],
        "corrections": "1) Do NOT record any Gur institution at הקונגרס 25 - delete or keep flagged as unverifiable. 2) The only documented synagogue on רחוב הקונגרס is בית כנסת פועלי צדק at הקונגרס 21 / צ'לנוב 31 - a non-Hasidic (פועלים) synagogue, NOT Gur. 3) Real Gur addresses in Tel Aviv: פיירברג 17 (לב העיר, per Tel Aviv Religious Council) and שטיבלאך גור at הדף היומי (Neve Sharett / קריית הרי\"ם לוין), with historic presence on בר אילן and יבנה. 4) Glatter does NOT assign Gur any street/house number; do not cite a Glatter file as support for #25. 5) If the map pin must be resolved, treat it as a coordinate/street error and pursue archival lookup (עיריית ת\"א / עמותות records); the coordinates reportedly fall near קלישר/נחלת בנימין, not southern Hakongres. Net: the claim is internally honest and its skeptical conclusion is correct; only its existence as a map entry (a phantom site) is the problem, hence mostly-solid rather than fully solid."
