        "addressCheck": "CONFIRMED by multiple independent sources, NOT dependent on Glatter. (1) GuideStar / Registrar of Associations: \"אגודת בית הכנסת חסידי גור ברח' פירברג 17 תל אביב יפו (ע\"ר)\", reg. no. 580162410. (2) Tel Aviv-Jaffa Religious Council (rabanut.co.il) lists \"חסידי גור\" at \"פיירברג 17, לב העיר\", nusach Ashkenaz, active, with prayer times and caretaker number. (3) easy.co.il synagogue directory for Feierberg 17. (4) Rabbinical High Court ruling (תיק 1389698/3, 2023) explicitly concerns the building at Fierberg 17 dedicated to Chasidei Gur. Note: Glatter itself does NOT give a house number for Gur — the \"17\" rests entirely on registrar/religious-council/court sources, which is sufficient. Alternate spellings: פירברג/פיירברג/פיארברג (Feierberg/Fierberg/Piarberg).",
