        "founderCheck": "REAL, with correct framing. R. Yitzchak Meir Alter (1799–1866) is a genuine historical figure and the founder of the GUR DYNASTY — not of this Tel Aviv shtibel. The research is careful and honest: it labels him \"מייסד שושלת גור\" and marks the local shtibel's founding year \"unknown.\" So no false tying of the founder to this address, and no anachronism. The actual local \"founders\" per the court ruling were the 1944 hekdesh donors Meir Chanoch Kahan and his wife Rebecca — a detail the research lacked but which does not contradict it.",
